1:["$","$Le",null,{"reaction":{"id":"fluorine","formula":"¹⁹F(p,α)¹⁶O","tag":["氟的恒星演化","The stellar evolution of fluorine"],"title":["质子反应改变恒星中的氟丰度","Proton reactions change stellar fluorine abundances"],"text":["氟-19 俘获质子并放出 α 粒子，是恒星中氟的重要消耗通道。准确测量其低能反应率，有助于理解氟的丰度，以及渐近巨星支恒星中的氟超丰现象。","Fluorine-19 captures a proton and emits an alpha particle, an important fluorine-destruction pathway in stars. Accurate low-energy rates help explain fluorine abundances and fluorine enhancement in asymptotic giant branch stars."],"task":["分辨低能共振及不同末态分支，检验恒星核反应网络。","Resolve low-energy resonances and final-state branches to test stellar reaction networks."],"type":["氢燃烧","Hydrogen burning"],"product":"¹⁶O + α","input":"¹⁹F + p","particle":"α","tone":"warm","publicProgress":["2021 年论文直接测量 ¹⁹F(p,αγ)¹⁶O 的伴随 γ 射线分支；2022 年进一步研究 ¹⁹F(p,γ)²⁰Ne 对 CNO 循环突破的影响。","The 2021 paper measures gamma-emitting branches of ¹⁹F(p,αγ)¹⁶O. The 2022 work extends the programme to ¹⁹F(p,γ)²⁰Ne and CNO breakout."],"detector":["α 粒子发射后，若 ¹⁶O 留在激发态，其退激 γ 射线可由 BGO 阵列记录；这一方法测量伴随 γ 射线的分支。","If alpha emission leaves ¹⁶O excited, its de-excitation gamma rays can be recorded by the BGO array. This method measures gamma-emitting branches."],"references":["fluorine-destruction-2021","cno-breakout-2022"]}}]
